## Code derived from OpenAI Codex

Two pieces of behaviour in this repository are re-implementations of logic in
the OpenAI Codex CLI, which is licensed under the Apache License 2.0
(Copyright 2025 OpenAI):

  * The animation data table in `assets/pet/animations.json` reproduces the
    sprite indices and per-frame durations defined in
    `codex-rs/tui/src/pets/model.rs` (`default_animations`, `idle_animation`,
    `app_state_animation`).

  * The frame-selection algorithm in `app/Sources/HooklingCore/AnimationPlayer.swift`
    is a Swift re-implementation of `current_animation_frame` /
    `frame_at_elapsed` in `codex-rs/tui/src/pets/ambient.rs`, and the sprite
    grid geometry in `app/Sources/HooklingCore/SpriteSheet.swift` follows
    `codex-rs/tui/src/pets/catalog.rs` and `frames.rs`.

No Codex source code was copied verbatim. These are independent Swift
implementations of the documented behaviour, written so that this pet animates
identically to the Codex terminal pet. See docs/codex-pet-analysis.md for the
exact upstream files and line ranges consulted.

Upstream project: https://github.com/openai/codex (Apache-2.0)

