## Seedy artwork — NOT distributed with this project

The Seedy character artwork (`seedy-spritesheet-v4.webp`) is OpenAI's. It is
not committed to this repository, and this project grants you no rights to it.

The Codex repository does not contain the spritesheet either; Codex downloads
it at runtime from an OpenAI CDN into the user's own `CODEX_HOME` cache.
This project reads the copy already present on your machine.

See docs/licensing.md for the full analysis.
